# Collective Brutality on turn 3 with two of its three modes chosen (CR 700.2, "choose one or more"), so escalate is
# paid once: Bot1 discards Demonic Tutor as the spell is cast, then takes Bot2's only instant off the revealed hand and
# drains two. Choosing the third mode as well would cost a second discard, and it is not on offer here anyway: Bot2
# has no creature for it to target. The Island in Bot2's graveyard is its turn-2 discard to hand size.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Collective Brutality
Demonic Tutor
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Lightning Bolt
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Collective Brutality.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1; 3)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Demonic Tutor)
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Collective Brutality; Demonic Tutor
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Island
